{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-19 22:50:00', 'title': 'FILING DEADLINE--KUZNICKI LAW PLLC ANNOUNCES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF MEDTRONIC PLC - MDT', 'text': 'CEDARHURST, N.Y. , OCT. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE SECURITIES LITIGATION LAW FIRM OF KUZNICKI LAW PLLC ISSUES THIS ALERT TO SHAREHOLDERS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE: MDT), IF THEY PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SHARES BETWEEN JUNE 8, 2019, AND MAY 25, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-19 19:56:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS MEDTRONIC PLC INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022 - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 19, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN MEDTRONIC PLC ("MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF MEDTRONIC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF MINNESOTA.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-19 08:30:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC EXPANDS GLOBAL ACCESS TO THE BENEFITS OF ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY', 'text': 'HUGO™ ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY SYSTEM REGULATORY APPROVAL IN JAPAN PROVIDES ACCESS TO THIRD LARGEST ROBOTICS MARKET IN THE WORLD WHILE GENERAL SURGERY APPROVAL IN THE EU AND CANADA OPEN FAST-GROWING HERNIA SPECIALTY DUBLIN , OCT. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), A GLOBAL HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY LEADER, HAS ANNOUNCED THREE SIGNIFICANT GLOBAL MARKET-ENTRANCE AND INDICATION EXPANSION APPROVALS FOR ITS HUGO™ ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY (RAS) SYSTEM. THE APPROVALS INCLUDE: CONFORMITÉ EUROPÉENNE (CE) MARK CLEARANCE FOR GENERAL SURGERY INDICATION; HEALTH CANADA LICENCE FOR GENERAL LAPAROSCOPIC SURGERY INDICATION; AND MINISTRY OF HEALTH, LABOR, AND WELFARE (MHLW) APPROVAL FOR UROLOGIC SURGICAL AND GYNECOLOGIC LAPAROSCOPIC INDICATIONS IN JAPAN.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-19 00:41:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (""MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE:\xa0MDT). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}